  "remarks": "Andrey Molchanov is a leading Russian businessperson and a member of the Kremlin-aligned ruling party “United Russia”. He is an important shareholder in and the former CEO of the LSR Group, a real estate company and the biggest producer of construction materials in Russia. In 2024, the LSR Group’s revenue amounted to 239 billion rubles. The construction sector provides a substantial source of revenue to the government of the Russian Federation. Therefore, Andrey Molchanov is a leading businessperson operating in Russia and a businessperson involved in economic sectors providing a substantial source of revenue to the Government of the Russian Federation, which is responsible for the annexation of Crimea and the destabilisation of Ukraine.",
